# Umami Analytics Configuration
#
# Get your website ID from Umami Cloud dashboard (https://cloud.umami.is)
# This is a public identifier safe to expose in client-side code
#
# Format: UUID string from Umami website settings
# Example: PUBLIC_UMAMI_WEBSITE_ID=348f2ca9-68a7-422f-849c-36aff2630c8a
PUBLIC_UMAMI_WEBSITE_ID=your-website-id-here
